<title>USA: Charming to open about 25 stores in 1997.</title>
<headline>Charming to open about 25 stores in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BENSALEM, Pa. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charming Shoppes Inc said Thursday that it expects to open about 25 stores during the current fiscal year, which ends February 1.</p>
<p>The company opened two new stores and closed five during the period February through April, bringing the total number of operating stores to 1,131 in 43 states at the end of the first quarter, on May 3.</p>
<p>Charming Shoppes operates under the names &quot;Fashion Bug&quot; and &quot;Fashion Bug Plus.&quot;</p>
